title = "Teacher's Pet or Rebellion"
message = "Responses have weighted outcomes. Choose any response. In this safe example, polite or neutral can earn Teacher's Pet; successful sass earns Rebellion and REP.

The different buffs rely on your respnonse, my mood, and a bit of luck:

[color=#88FF88]Teacher's Pet[/color] can be a powerfull buff adding points, multipliers or money.

[color=#FF88FF]Rebellion[/color] gives a straight up multiplier and extra rolls."
